BEHAVIOR is-negative

DESCRIPTION
  Checks if an integer value is negative (less than 0).
  Returns 1 if negative, 0 otherwise.

CONTRACT
  INPUT value int 8
  OUTPUT result int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH b15b0b3a

IMPLEMENTATION
  v = LOAD value 8
  is_neg = ILT v 0 8
  STORE result is_neg 8
END
